{
    "title": "Vio.com: Hotels & travel deals",
    "description": "Vio.com \u2013 the ultimate travel booking app \u2013 empowers you to swiftly and effortlessly compare hotel prices and seize the finest hotel deals around the globe. Seamlessly explore millions of hotels and diverse locations, and get guaranteed access to unparalleled hotel and travel deals.\r\n\r\nYour gateway to the best hotel deals \u2013 Vio.com ensures an exceptional experience:\r\n- Compare hotel prices originating from 100+ booking sites.\r\n- Unlock unmatched hotel deals globally.\r\n- Secure exceptional savings of up to 50% on your next hotel reservation.\r\n- Simplify the booking process of your vacation or trip with Vio.com's powerful hotel search.\r\n- Embark on a trip to discover your perfect hotel with a variety of filters and choices.\r\n- Stay well-informed through comprehensive hotel reviews aggregated from 100+ travel platforms.\r\n- Book accommodations with Vio.com, sporting a Trustpilot rating of 4+ stars from over 5000 reviews.\r\n\r\nHassle-free, fast, and convenient hotel booking\r\n- Compare and discover hotel deal options and locations worldwide. \r\n- Vio.com finds hotel booking deals that other websites want to keep secret. \r\n- Accommodation deals, surpass the usual challenges of searching and booking.\r\n- Explore deals of travel sites, spanning over 100 reputable platforms including Booking.com, Expedia, Hotels.com, Agoda, Priceline, and HotelTonight. \r\n- Experience deals of up to 45% off on your next booking.\r\n\r\nPowerful hotel search & discovery\r\n- Effortlessly plan your next vacation or trip, compare, find, and book the ideal hotel deal.\r\n- Navigate the booking process confidently with hotel reviews from over 100 well-known travel sites including Booking.com, Expedia, Hotels.com, Agoda, Priceline, and HotelTonight. Book yourself in the best hotel deals on the Vio.com app.\r\n\r\nThe best hotel deals in one app\r\n- Maximize your travel budget's potential and save on your next hotel booking.\r\n- Find and book amazing discounts and deals on hotels for your next trip and travel for less.\r\n- Find the best prices from millions of hotels worldwide and enjoy your travels.\r\n\r\nHotel comparison superpowers\r\n- Search hotel bookings by price and location.\r\n- Compare and book the best hotel deals.\r\n- Sort hotels by category, price, hotel type, and more.\r\n- Browse hotels by specific area with map search functionality.\r\n\r\nA secure hotel choice for your journey\r\nJoin 100+ million travelers who have booked with Vio.com since 2016. With a 4+ star rating on Trustpilot from over 5000 reviews, Vio.com is your reliable and dependable option for hotel and travel bookings. Find, compare, and book hotel accommodations with the help of our trusted support team.\r\n\r\nMore than hotels\r\nSearch and book the best private rentals and homestays, and discover homes that best suit your trip. Book a more authentic travel experience and get the inside scoop from your local expert hosts. Choose stays that match your needs exactly, and enjoy the best booking with the best travel deal available.\r\n\r\nNeed assistance with Vio.com bookings? Visit us at https://support.vio.com/hc/en-us\r\n\r\nJoin us at https://www.vio.com/ for travel inspiration.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Vio.com \u2013 the ultimate travel booking app \u2013 empowers you to swiftly and effortlessly compare hotel prices and seize the finest hotel deals around the globe. Seamlessly explore millions of hotels and diverse locations, and get guaranteed access to unparalleled hotel and travel deals.<br><br>Your gateway to the best hotel deals \u2013 Vio.com ensures an exceptional experience:<br>- Compare hotel prices originating from 100+ booking sites.<br>- Unlock unmatched hotel deals globally.<br>- Secure exceptional savings of up to 50% on your next hotel reservation.<br>- Simplify the booking process of your vacation or trip with Vio.com&#39;s powerful hotel search.<br>- Embark on a trip to discover your perfect hotel with a variety of filters and choices.<br>- Stay well-informed through comprehensive hotel reviews aggregated from 100+ travel platforms.<br>- Book accommodations with Vio.com, sporting a Trustpilot rating of 4+ stars from over 5000 reviews.<br><br>Hassle-free, fast, and convenient hotel booking<br>- Compare and discover hotel deal options and locations worldwide. <br>- Vio.com finds hotel booking deals that other websites want to keep secret. <br>- Accommodation deals, surpass the usual challenges of searching and booking.<br>- Explore deals of travel sites, spanning over 100 reputable platforms including Booking.com, Expedia, Hotels.com, Agoda, Priceline, and HotelTonight. <br>- Experience deals of up to 45% off on your next booking.<br><br>Powerful hotel search &amp; discovery<br>- Effortlessly plan your next vacation or trip, compare, find, and book the ideal hotel deal.<br>- Navigate the booking process confidently with hotel reviews from over 100 well-known travel sites including Booking.com, Expedia, Hotels.com, Agoda, Priceline, and HotelTonight. Book yourself in the best hotel deals on the Vio.com app.<br><br>The best hotel deals in one app<br>- Maximize your travel budget&#39;s potential and save on your next hotel booking.<br>- Find and book amazing discounts and deals on hotels for your next trip and travel for less.<br>- Find the best prices from millions of hotels worldwide and enjoy your travels.<br><br>Hotel comparison superpowers<br>- Search hotel bookings by price and location.<br>- Compare and book the best hotel deals.<br>- Sort hotels by category, price, hotel type, and more.<br>- Browse hotels by specific area with map search functionality.<br><br>A secure hotel choice for your journey<br>Join 100+ million travelers who have booked with Vio.com since 2016. With a 4+ star rating on Trustpilot from over 5000 reviews, Vio.com is your reliable and dependable option for hotel and travel bookings. Find, compare, and book hotel accommodations with the help of our trusted support team.<br><br>More than hotels<br>Search and book the best private rentals and homestays, and discover homes that best suit your trip. Book a more authentic travel experience and get the inside scoop from your local expert hosts. Choose stays that match your needs exactly, and enjoy the best booking with the best travel deal available.<br><br>Need assistance with Vio.com bookings? Visit us at https://support.vio.com/hc/en-us<br><br>Join us at https://www.vio.com/ for travel inspiration.",
